#95150
"Entrance Room"
"This room has been constructed with one major theme in mind; most everything

is round.  From the grey-flecked granite floor tiles to the small windows,

even the picture frames around painted portraits - it's all round.  The room

is decorated simply, with items one might find in a prosperous farmhouse.  A

blue and red braided rug adds warmth to the room, as does the rustic wrought

iron chandelier which hangs from a chain in the center of the low ceiling. 

Two circular doors, to the east and west, are labeled \"Storage Closet\" and

\"Living Room,\" respectively.

"
"[Olah] Out to room 28024

"
