#95151
"Bank Room"
"While bigger than a clothing closet, this storage room is just barely large

enough to hold two or three people at a time, as all the equipment and odds

and ends take up most of the floor.  Larger items, such as armor full burlap

bags, are neatly arranged on the ground.  Smaller items have been placed into

natural shelves, which have been dug into the earthen walls and given a plank

bottom.

"
"[Olah] Storage room.  DO NOT PURGE here!

"
