#95152
"Meeting Room"
"Couches surround a low, circular table in this room, which seems designed to

be as conducive to conversation as possible.  The room itself is paneled in

rough-hewn redwood, which has been lacquered til smooth.  A red brick

fireplace has been built into the wall at the end opposite the door.  The

mantelpiece over the hearth holds a collection of odd trinkets, as well as a

brightly-painted portrait of a group of smiling halflings.

"
